@baseUrl = https://localhost:8010/camplib/v1

### ============================================================
### Books API
### Seed-based manual API test
### ============================================================
###
### Important:
### The database should be deleted/reset before running this file.
### This file rebuilds the required Catalog seed data through the public API.
###
### Seed.cs is the source of the stable ids.
### The .http file creates the seed data through HTTP.
### ============================================================
@author1Id = a0000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@author2Id = a0000002-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@author3Id = a0000003-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@author4Id = a0000004-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@author5Id = a0000005-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

@book1Id = b0000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@book2Id = b0000002-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@book3Id = b0000003-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@book4Id = b0000004-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

@bookItem1Id = be000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@bookItem2Id = be000002-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@bookItem3Id = be000003-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@bookItem4Id = be000004-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@bookItem5Id = be000005-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@bookItem6Id = be000006-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

@book1Isbn = 9780132350884
@book2Isbn = 9780321125217
@book3Isbn = 9780201485677
@book4Isbn = 9780201633610

@unknownBookId = b9999999-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@unknownAuthorId = a9999999-0000-0000-0000-000000000000


### 1. Create seed books =======================================================

### Create seed book 1: Clean Code
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Code",
  "subtitle": "A Handbook of Agile Software Craftsmanship",
  "isbn": "{{book1Isbn}}",
  "id": "{{book1Id}}"
}


### Create seed book 2: Domain-Driven Design
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Domain-Driven Design",
  "subtitle": "Tackling Complexity in the Heart of Software",
  "isbn": "{{book2Isbn}}",
  "id": "{{book2Id}}"
}


### Create seed book 3: Refactoring
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Refactoring",
  "subtitle": "Improving the Design of Existing Code",
  "isbn": "{{book3Isbn}}",
  "id": "{{book3Id}}"
}


### Create seed book 4: Design Patterns
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Design Patterns",
  "subtitle": "Elements of Reusable Object-Oriented Software",
  "isbn": "{{book4Isbn}}",
  "id": "{{book4Id}}"
}

### 2. Assign seed authors to seed books ====================================
### Assign Robert C. Martin to Clean Code
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/{{book1Id}}/authors
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "authorId": "{{author1Id}}"
}


### Assign Eric Evans to Domain-Driven Design
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/{{book2Id}}/authors
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "authorId": "{{author2Id}}"
}


### Assign Martin Fowler to Refactoring
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/{{book3Id}}/authors
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "authorId": "{{author3Id}}"
}


### Assign Kent Beck to Refactoring
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/{{book3Id}}/authors
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "authorId": "{{author5Id}}"
}


### Assign Erich Gamma to Design Patterns
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/{{book4Id}}/authors
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "authorId": "{{author4Id}}"
}


### Assign Martin Fowler to Design Patterns
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/{{book4Id}}/authors
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "authorId": "{{author3Id}}"
}


### 3. Add seed BookItems to seed books =========================================
### Add BookItem 1 to Clean Code
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/{{book1Id}}/items
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "inventoryNumber": "CL-BOOK-0001",
  "id": "{{bookItem1Id}}"
}


### Add BookItem 2 to Clean Code
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/{{book1Id}}/items
Content-Type: application/json
